    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "04. Making Attacks",
    "ruleNumber": "04.00",
    "order": 73,
    "anchor": "04.00",
    "summary": "When shooting or fighting, a unit's attacks are made in 3 steps:\n\n1. [Select Weapons](vsdata:core-rule/select-weapons) (04.01), for each model\n2. [Select Targets](vsdata:core-rule/select-targets) (04.02), for each weapon\n3. [Resolve Attacks](vsdata:core-rule/resolve-attacks) (04.03)\n\nThe [active player](vsdata:core-rule/active-player-and-opposing-player) carries them out; here that means whoever controls the unit **selected to shoot** or fight, until its attacks are resolved (01.03).",
